83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_comp_equiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_comp_equiv","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesTorusLink.lean#L76-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_sum","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesTorusLink.lean#L72-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_gam_eq_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_gam_eq_sum","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesTorusLink.lean#L56-L68","doc":"**The weight-space traces of `γ^p` from those of the two weighted rotations**, for every\n`p`: `T_m(γ^p) = Σ_{j ≤ m} T_j(ρ^p) − Σ_{j < m} T_j(ρ'^p)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}